{"unit_id":"AlLHHH__dsh-skill-palette#card-zh","repo":"AlLHHH/dsh-skill-palette","commit":"8be21c00a96b909585c8d1d6f9e9b7382639c844","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"SkillMate（DSH 网页端技能插件）：让你在 DSH 中浏览并调用已安装的技能。它在输入框旁提供技能面板，并在设置页加入偏好选项、在回答末尾显示本轮调用的技能。主要功能包括按用途分类和搜索技能、收藏与查看最近使用、把技能命令插入输入框、为缺少中文说明的技能调用默认模型翻译，以及显示回答所用技能。适合经常安装多种技能、希望更快找到合适技能并查看调用情况的 DSH 用户。翻译使用 DSH 已选默认模型，另有版本检查会查询 npm registry；无需单独配置 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2273-2334","lib/index.js:209-258","lib/index.js:104-129"]}
{"unit_id":"AlLHHH__dsh-skill-palette#card-en","repo":"AlLHHH/dsh-skill-palette","commit":"8be21c00a96b909585c8d1d6f9e9b7382639c844","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"SkillMate helps DSH users find and invoke skills. Its composer picker groups and searches skills, tracks favourites and recent use, and inserts a command. It shows skills used in each reply and translates missing Chinese descriptions through the default model, caching them locally.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2273-2334","lib/index.js:209-258","lib/index.js:104-129"]}
